# stand-alone files, and this repo is public. The three originals are kept
# local (download them from mixkit.co — names are in scripts/cut-recordings.py);
# the short clips cut from them, which the app ships, are committed.
cognicare/assets/audio/source/originals/mixkit-*
play-upload/
